    <main id="main-content" class="section-container" >
        




<section class="section cards"  >
    <div class="section-inner ">
         <div class="row" >
    <div class="columns small-12 medium-4 large-4 end hide-for-medium"  >
                <img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAzIDIiPjwvc3ZnPg==" data-src="/-/media/danske-bank-images/global/images/generic/business-woman-at-her-desk.jpg?h=450&amp;iar=0&amp;mw=800&amp;w=800&amp;rev=00af1ed684a849ff988e78b1e2448e90&hash=E2448206C590D825B877F35FC27EF843" class="lazyload" alt="" width="800" height="450" />
        </div>

</div>
                 </div>
</section>

<section class="section cards"  >
    <div class="section-inner ">
         <div class="row"  data-equalizer="eq92300370b355" data-equalize-on="medium">
    <div class="columns medium-5 large-5 show-for-medium" data-equalizer-watch="eq92300370b355" >
        <div class="card">
                    <div style="background-image:url(&quot;/-/media/danske-bank-images/global/images/generic/business-woman-at-her-desk.jpg?rev=00af1ed684a849ff988e78b1e2448e90&amp;mw=800&amp;hash=BE4213DB0DFFF50FE50FD359D6648FF8&quot;);background-position:50% 50%;background-size:cover;" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        
            </div>
            </div>
    </div><div class="columns small-12 medium-7 large-7 end" data-equalizer-watch="eq92300370b355" >
        <div class="card">
                    <div style="background-image:url(&quot;/-/media/danske-bank-images/dbuk/graphics/campaigns/thrive/blue.jpg?rev=7addda0053094b5a902cba4b5de626f6&amp;mw=800&amp;hash=D41616FDA2815F6AE90EC5B4269C787F&quot;);background-position:50% 50%;background-size:cover;" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><h1 class="custom-header-2">Register for eBanking</h1>

<p class="intro">Registering for eBanking is simple. Complete the online form and we'll post you your log on details. You should receive these in 7 - 10 business days.</p>

<a href="#register" class="button large" data-tracking-id="register-for-ebanking-banner-register-anchor">Register for eBanking</a></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div>
                 </div>
</section><div class="spacer-40"></div>

<section class="section cards"  >
    <div class="section-inner ">
         <div class="row" >
    <div class="columns small-12 text-center medium-8 medium-offset-2 medium-text-center large-6 large-offset-3 end"  >
        <div class="card card-theme-yellow-2">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><p style="margin-bottom: 0rem;">If you’re already set up for eBanking but need a reminder of your User ID or passcode, please call <a href="tel:03456002882">0345 600 2882</a> so we can help you get back online. You’ll also find your User ID on your Danske Mobile Banking app (in the Contact information section, under Profile).</p></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div><div class="spacer-40"></div><div class="row"  data-equalizer="eq9a334663be2a" data-equalize-on="medium">
    <div class="columns small-12 medium-8 medium-offset-2 large-5 large-offset-1" data-equalizer-watch="eq9a334663be2a" >
        <div class="card card-blue-1">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><h2>Good to know</h2>

<p>With eBanking you can:</p>

<ul class="check-list">
    <li>Manage your accounts, check balances and pay bills</li>
    <li>Transfer money and make payments</li>
    <li>View or delete Direct Debits and set up and amend standing orders</li>
    <li>Apply for overdrafts, new accounts and personal loans</li>
    <li>Order foreign currency</li>
</ul>

<p>Once you’re set up for eBanking, you can download the <a href="/personal/ways-to-bank/mobile-banking-app">Danske Mobile Banking app</a> to manage your money 24 hours a day, no matter where you are.</p></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div><div class="columns small-12 medium-8 medium-offset-2 large-5 large-offset-0 end" data-equalizer-watch="eq9a334663be2a" >
        <div class="card card-blue-1">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><h2>Need to know</h2>
<ul>
  <li>We’ll never ask you to reveal PINs, credit or debit card numbers over the phone, through email or by text.</li>
  <li>These services may be temporarily unavailable when we are carrying out routine maintenance.</li>
</ul></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div><div class="spacer-40"></div>
                 </div>
</section>

<section class="section cards"  >
    <div class="section-inner no-top-padding">
         <div class="row" >
    <div class="columns small-12 medium-8 medium-offset-2 large-6 large-offset-3 end"  >
        <div class="card card-primary-white no-top-padding no-bottom-padding">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><h4>We will use this information to process your application</h4>

<p>To register for eBanking, please complete the form below. Before you do, please read the <a href="/-/media/danske-bank/uk/personal/files/important-documentation/special-ts-cs-ebanking-and-electronic-signature.pdf?rev=907ef02fd233485c82392e18126f08c5&amp;hash=41867FBE8141F9715B14A8C91DE8CF52" target="_blank" alt="eBanking terms and conditions">Special Terms and Conditions eBanking and Electronic Signature (PDF)<span class="download-icon-blue_xx" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>. You will be bound by these terms and conditions when you first log on and use eBanking. If you are unsure of any of the information within these, please contact us.</p>
<br></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div><a name="register"></a><div class="row collapse" >
    <div class="columns medium-8 medium-offset-2 end"  >
        <div class="card card-blue-6">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
                    <form method="post" id="ngForm-2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E" class="ngcontactform">
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-lang" name="__lanCode" value="en-UK" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-subject" name="__formSubj" value="Webform: Register for eBanking | Online Banking Registration | Danske Bank" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-formname" name="__webFormName" value="register for ebanking" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-dsid" name="__dsID" value="{4899F4F7-DF57-4707-B6CE-8217FBCA2543}" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-redirecturl" name="__redirectUrl" value="/personal/ways-to-bank/register-for-ebanking" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-fromEmail" name="__fromEmail" value="False" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-urlParam" name="__urlParam" value="True" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-isAutoReplyEnabled" name="__isAutoReplyEnabled" value="False" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-arId" name="__arId" />
                <input type="hidden" id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-asheLogin" name="__asheLogin" value="False" />
                <div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-12 input-set">
    <h3>Form - Register for eBanking</h3>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-12 input-set">
    <p>* Please complete all fields</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set">
    <label for="fullName">Full Name *</label>
    <input
      id="fullName"
      type="text"
      name="fullName"
      data-cblabel="Full Name"
      data-mappingfieldname="full_name"
      data-includeinmail="true"
      data-maptoegain="false"
      class="allow-symbols"
      required="required"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set end">
    <div
      data-module="date-picker"
      data-language="en-GB"
      data-legal-age="13"
      data-translations-url="/-/media/files/forms/commonjs/ngforms/date-picker-translations.json"
    >
      <label for="date1">Date of Birth (DD/MM/YYYY) *</label>
      <duet-date-picker
        required
        id="date1"
        min="1900-01-01"
        name="date1"
        identifier="datebirth"
        data-cblabel="Date of Birth"
        data-mappingfieldname="date1"
        data-includeinmail="true"
        data-maptoegain="false"
      >
      </duet-date-picker>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>




<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set">
    <label for="telephone">Mobile Number *</label>
    <input
      id="telephone"
      type="tel"
      name="telephone"
      autocomplete="tel"
      data-cblabel="Mobile Number"
      aria-label="Phone Number"
      data-mappingfieldname="customer_phone"
      data-includeinmail="true"
      data-maptoegain="false"
      required="required"
      class="number" minlength="10" maxlength="13"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set end">
    <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
    <input
      id="email"
      type="email"
      name="email"
      required="required"
      data-cblabel="Email Address"
      class="email"
      data-mappingfieldname="email"
      data-includeinmail="true"
      data-maptoegain="false"
      autocomplete="email"
    />
  </div>
</div>



<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set">
    <label for="sortCode">Sort Code *</label>
    <input
      id="sortCode"
      type="tel"
      name="sortCode"
      data-cblabel="Sort Code"
      data-mappingfieldname="sort_code_choice"
      data-includeinmail="true"
      data-maptoegain="false"
      class="sortCodeClass"
      required="required"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="columns large-6 input-set end">
    <label for="accountNumber">Account Number *</label>
    <input
      id="accountNumber"
      type="tel"
      name="accountNumber"
      data-cblabel="Account Number"
      data-mappingfieldname="account_number_choice"
      data-includeinmail="true"
      data-maptoegain="false"
      class="accountNumClass"
      required="required"
    />
  </div>
</div>


<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-10 input-set">
    <div role="group" aria-labelledby="receivestatements">
      <label id="receivestatements"
        >How would you like to receive your account statements and other
        documents? *</label
      >
      <input
        type="radio"
        required="required"
        id="receivestatementsdigital"
        name="receivestatementsRadio"
        data-cblabel="I want my statements and other documents (including those relating to my credit card), sent to my Electronic Mailbox"
        data-mappingfieldname="receive_statements"
        data-includeinmail="true"
        data-maptoegain="false"
        value="Yes"
        class="triggerResize radioCollection"
        checked="checked"
      />
      <label for="receivestatementsdigital"
        ><strong>Digital statements</strong>: I want all my account statements
        and other documents sent electronically. I understand that I will get an
        email notification when my latest statement is ready to view.
      </label>
      <input
        type="radio"
        required="required"
        id="receivestatementspaper"
        name="receivestatementsRadio"
        data-cblabel="I want to receive statements for all my accounts on paper"
        data-mappingfieldname="receive_statements"
        data-includeinmail="true"
        data-maptoegain="false"
        value="Yes"
        class="triggerResize radioCollection"
      />
      <label for="receivestatementspaper"
        ><strong>Paper statements</strong>: I want to continue to receive my
        statements on paper.</label
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</div>




<div class="row">
  <div class="columns large-10">
    <br />
    <p>
      The information you provide will be held by Danske Bank (Danske Bank is a
      trading name of Northern Bank Limited). We'll use it to process your
      request and help manage this account(s) and any services used. By
      continuing, you confirm you're happy with this and that you've had a
      chance to read the
      <a
        href="/personal/privacy-notice"
        data-tracking-id="register-for-ebanking-form-privacy-notice"
        target="_blank"
      >
        how we use your personal information page</a
      >.
    </p>
    <br />
  </div>
</div>











<script src="/js/datepicker/duet.js"></script>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="columns">
                <button class="button medium cta ngSendButton" id="ngSendButton-2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E">Submit</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-receipt" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" role="dialog"
               data-role="modal-alert"
               class="reveal reveal-modal full modal-alert">
            <div data-role="modal-alert-background" class="modal-alert-background"></div>
            <div data-role="success-alert-wrapper" class="modal-alert-inner success-wrapper">
                <div tabindex="0" aria-live="assertive" class="callout alert-box radius success">
                    <div class="h3">Thank you</div>
                    <div>
                        <p>You'll receive your eBanking logon details shortly in the post.</p>
<br><br>Kind Regards,<br>Danske Bank<br>
                    </div>
                    <button data-close id="2F7B1135121241219BCDE7A3F6EADE8E-receipt-close" tabindex="0" aria-label="Close"
                            class="close close-reveal-modal">
                        <svg class="icon close">
                            <use xlink:href="#svg-close"></use>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </aside>


            </form>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div><div class="spacer-40"></div>
                 </div>
</section>

<section class="section cards"  >
    <div class="section-inner ">
         <div class="row" >
    <div class="columns small-12 medium-8 medium-offset-2 large-6 large-offset-3 end"  >
        <div class="card card-blue-1">
                    <div style="" class="card-back"></div>
            <div class="card-content ">
        <span><h3 class="h2">What happens next?</h3>

<p>We’ll issue you with an Electronic Signature to log on to eBanking and the Danske Mobile Banking app. Your Electronic Signature is made up of 3 parts:</p>

<ul>
    <li>An 8 digit User ID</li>
    <li>A 4 digit passcode (we’ll issue you with a temporary passcode which must be changed the first time you log on)</li>
    <li>A way to generate a one-time passcode using our Danske ID app or eSafeID device.</li>
</ul>

<p>If you have a smartphone, find out more about our security app. <a href="/personal/ways-to-bank/danske-id">Danske ID</a>, and download the app to enable you to log on to eBanking for the first time, once you have received the remainder of your electronic signature.</p>

<p>If you do not have a smartphone, you can use an eSafeID device instead. We recommend ordering it as soon as you have registered for eBanking. The eSafeID device generates a six digit code that lets you log on securely.</p>

<p>To order your eSafeID, visit your local branch or contact Customer Support on <a href="tel:03456002882">0345 600 2882</a>.</p></span>

            </div>
            </div>
    </div>

</div><div class="spacer-60"></div><div class="row">
    <div class="columns medium-8 medium-offset-2 article-header text-center">
                        <h2>
                    FAQs
                </h2>
            </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="columns medium-8 medium-offset-2">
        <ul data-module="responsive-nav" class="responsive-nav"  >
<li class="nav-item"  >
    <button class="responsive-nav-item" data-tracking-id="Accordian Simple Tab - Where can I find my sort code?">
        <span  >Where can I find my sort code?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon arrow-down "><use xlink:href="#svg-arrow-down"></use></svg>
    </button>
    <article class="responsive-nav-article" >
        <span ><p>You can find your sort code and account number at the top of your bank statement. The sort code is the first 6 digits (it will always start with 950) and your account number is the last 8 digits. </p></span>
        
    </article>
</li>
<li class="nav-item"  >
    <button class="responsive-nav-item" data-tracking-id="Accordian Simple Tab - How long will it take to receive my logon details?">
        <span  >How long will it take to receive my logon details?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon arrow-down "><use xlink:href="#svg-arrow-down"></use></svg>
    </button>
    <article class="responsive-nav-article" >
        <span ><p>We'll post you your log on details. You should receive these in 7 - 10 business days. If you have not received your log on details after 10 business days, please contact Customer Support on <a href="tel:03456002882">0345 600 2882</a>.</p></span>
        
    </article>
</li>
<li class="nav-item"  >
    <button class="responsive-nav-item" data-tracking-id="Accordian Simple Tab - Can I change from paper to digital statements at a later date?">
        <span  >Can I change from paper to digital statements at a later date?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon arrow-down "><use xlink:href="#svg-arrow-down"></use></svg>
    </button>
    <article class="responsive-nav-article" >
        <span ><p>Of course. You can change your preference at any time and request digital statements via our <a href="/personal/help/go-paperless" alt="complete this form to get paperless statements">online form</a>.</p></span>
        
    </article>
</li>
<li class="nav-item"  >
    <button class="responsive-nav-item" data-tracking-id="Accordian Simple Tab - What happens when I log on to eBanking for the first time?">
        <span  >What happens when I log on to eBanking for the first time?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" class="icon arrow-down "><use xlink:href="#svg-arrow-down"></use></svg>
    </button>
    <article class="responsive-nav-article" >
        <span ><p>When you log on to eBanking for the first time, you'll need to change your temporary passcode and activate either Danske ID or your eSafeID.</p>

<p>Watch our <a href="/personal/ways-to-bank/digital-banking-from-home?section=log-on" alt="Video guide showing you how to log on to Digital Banking for the first time">video guide</a>&nbsp;to help you get logged on for the first time or visit our <a href="/personal/ways-to-bank/setup-guide-for-ebanking" alt="Set up guide for eBanking">eBanking setup guide page</a>.</p></span>
        
    </article>
</li>
        </ul>
